@* 换一个触发字符：# 引用单据。Prefix 两边要一致（输入框与显示）；没有匹配时列表里给一句提示（Empty）；
   字数、清空、外观同 Textarea。显示时用 MentionText 的 ChildContent 把引用做成链接 *@
@inherits RuneComponent

<Card>
    <Flex Direction="LayoutDirection.Column" Gap="SpaceScale.Md">
        <Field Label="处理说明" Description="输入 # 引用单据：按单号过滤，引用过的单据会挂在这条说明下面">
            <Mentions TItem="ListboxOption" Items="orders" @bind-Value="note" @bind-Mentioned="cited" Prefix="#" Rows="3" maxlength="200"
                      ShowCount="true" Clearable="true" Variant="InputVariant.Soft">
                <Empty>没有这个单号；只能引用近 30 天的单据</Empty>
            </Mentions>
        </Field>
        <Flex Direction="LayoutDirection.Column" Gap="SpaceScale.Xs">
            <Small Tone="TextTone.Muted">显示出来（引用是链接）</Small>
            <MentionText Text="@note" Options="orders" Prefix="#" Context="segment">
                <TextLink Href="@($"#{segment.Mention!.Value}")">@segment.Text</TextLink>
            </MentionText>
        </Flex>
        <Small Tone="TextTone.Muted">引用了 @cited.Count 张单据</Small>
        <Field Label="只读（已提交的说明）">
            <Mentions TItem="ListboxOption" Items="orders" Value="#PO-2024-0318 已到货，按 #QC-2024-0102 复检" Prefix="#" ReadOnly="true" />
        </Field>
    </Flex>
</Card>

@code {
    static readonly ListboxOption[] orders =
    [
        new("PO-2024-0318", "PO-2024-0318", Description: "液压阀组 · 华辰精密"),
        new("PO-2024-0325", "PO-2024-0325", Description: "密封件 · 恒通密封"),
        new("QC-2024-0102", "QC-2024-0102", Description: "来料检验 · 不合格 3 件"),
        new("RT-2024-0044", "RT-2024-0044", Description: "退货申请 · 待审批"),
    ];

    string? note = "#QC-2024-0102 的不合格品走退货，关联 ";
    IReadOnlyList<string> cited = [];
}
